  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why Bystanders Matter",
      "char_file": "시계_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "The person having a stroke",
        "often can't tell",
        "something's wrong",
        "",
        "That's why BE FAST is built",
        "for the people around them -",
        "family, coworkers,",
        "anyone nearby"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "First, Watch How They're Moving",
      "char_file": "안개_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Can they walk",
        "a straight line?",
        "",
        "Do they suddenly lean",
        "or drift to one side",
        "along with the dizziness?",
        "",
        "That's the \"B\" in BE FAST -",
        "a brain sign, not an ear sign"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Second, Check Face, Arm, Speech",
      "char_file": "확성기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Ask them to smile -",
        "does one side droop?",
        "",
        "Ask them to raise both arms -",
        "does one drift down?",
        "",
        "Ask them to repeat a sentence -",
        "does it come out slurred?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Even One Sign Means Call 911",
      "char_file": "전화기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Don't wait",
        "to see if it passes",
        "",
        "Don't drive them",
        "to the hospital yourself",
        "",
        "Call 911 -",
        "it gets treatment started sooner"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Every Minute Counts",
      "char_file": "시계_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Stroke treatment works best",
        "within 3 to 4.5 hours",
        "of symptoms starting",
        "",
        "The sooner 911 is called,",
        "the more brain",
        "can be saved"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Know Who's at Higher Risk",
      "char_file": "혈압계_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "High blood pressure,",
        "diabetes, and smoking",
        "",
        "all raise the risk -",
        "take unusual dizziness",
        "more seriously in these cases"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Keep This in Mind",
      "char_file": "담배_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Most dizziness",
        "is harmless",
        "",
        "But balance loss, facial drooping,",
        "arm weakness, or slurred speech",
        "with it means",
        "stroke emergency"
      ]
    }
  ],
